msgid "The SCF program"
msgstr "SCF 程序"

msgid ""
"The Hartree-Fock self-consistent field program is invoked by one of the "
"following commands:"
msgstr "Hartree-Fock 自洽场程序可通过以下任一命令调用："

msgid ""
"In contrast to older versions of ``molpro``, the ``HF`` and ``RHF`` "
"directives have identical functionality and can both be used for closed-"
"shell or open-shell calculations. Other aliases are ``HF-SCF`` or ``RHF-"
"SCF``."
msgstr ""
"与旧版 ``molpro`` 不同，\\ ``HF`` 和 ``RHF`` 指令具有相同的功能，均可用于闭壳层或开壳层计算。其他别名包括 ``HF-"
"SCF`` 或 ``RHF-SCF``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"Often, no further input is necessary. By default, the number of electrons is"
" equal to the nuclear charge. The wavefunction is assumed to be totally "
"symmetric (symmetry 1) for singlet calculations. The program attempts to "
"determine the occupation numbers and the ground state configuration from the"
" Aufbau principle. Normally, this works well in closed-shell and many open-"
"shell cases, but sometimes wrong occupations are obtained. Then the wave "
"function symmetry and spin need to be specified using a WF (wave function) "
"directive. Also, the ``OCC`` and/or ``CLOSED`` directives can be used to "
"force convergence to the desired state. The default behaviour can be "
"modified either by options on the command line, or by directives."
msgstr ""
"通常，无需进一步输入。默认情况下，电子数等于核电荷数。对于单重态计算，假定波函数是完全对称的（对称性 "
"1）。程序尝试根据奥夫鲍原理确定占据数和基态构型。通常，这在闭壳层和许多开壳层情况下效果良好，但有时会得到错误的占据数。此时需要使用 "
"WF（波函数）指令指定波函数对称性和自旋。此外，可以使用 ``OCC`` 和/或 ``CLOSED`` "
"指令强制收敛到所需状态。默认行为可以通过命令行选项或指令进行修改。"

msgid "Density fitting Hartree-Fock"
msgstr "密度拟合 Hartree-Fock"

msgid "Local density fitting Hartree-Fock"
msgstr "局域密度拟合 Hartree-Fock"

msgid "Using"
msgstr "使用"

msgid "The following options can be used to affect the local approximations:"
msgstr "以下选项可用于影响局域近似："

msgid ""
"For more information about local fitting see R. Polly, H.-J. Werner, F. R. "
"Manby, and Peter J. Knowles, *Fast Hartree-Fock theory using local density "
"fitting approximations*, `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/0026897042000274801>`__ **102**, 2311 (2004) and"
" C. Köppl and H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.jctc.6b00251>`__ **12**, 3122-3134 (2016)."
msgstr ""
"关于局域拟合的更多信息，请参阅 R. Polly, H.-J. Werner, F. R. Manby, and Peter J. Knowles, "
"*Fast Hartree-Fock theory using local density fitting approximations*, `Mol."
" Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/0026897042000274801>`__ **102**, 2311 "
"(2004) 以及 C. Köppl and H.-J. Werner, `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.jctc.6b00251>`__ **12**, 3122-3134 (2016)。"

msgid ""
"**All publications resulting from LDF-HF or LDF-KS calculations should cite "
"this work.**"
msgstr "**所有基于 LDF-HF 或 LDF-KS 计算发表的成果均应引用此项工作。**"

msgid "Configuration-averaged Hartree-Fock (CAHF or DF-CAHF)"
msgstr "组态平均 Hartree-Fock (CAHF 或 DF-CAHF)"

msgid "This program (available since Molpro2020.3) is called using"
msgstr "该程序（自 Molpro2020.3 起可用）通过以下方式调用"

msgid "or, with density fitting,"
msgstr "或者，使用密度拟合时，"

msgid ""
"It yields orbitals which are equivalent to the orbitals of a state-averaged "
"CASSCF calculation averaging over all states of all possible spin-manifolds "
"given by a chosen active space, where the states of different spin-manifolds"
" are given weighting factors corresponding to their MS-degeneracy. It is "
"also possible to define two or more shells of active orbitals, and the "
"calculation is then equivalent to a state-averaged RASSCF (restricted active"
" space) calculation in which the configuration space is the direct product "
"of the given CASSCF subspaces."
msgstr ""
"它产生的轨道等价于一个态平均 CASSCF 计算（对给定活性空间所有可能自旋多重态的所有态进行平均）的轨道，其中不同自旋多重态的态被赋予与其 MS "
"简并度相对应的权重因子。也可以定义两个或更多个活性轨道壳层，此时计算等价于一个态平均 RASSCF（限制活性空间）计算，其中组态空间是给定 CASSCF"
" 子空间的直积。"

msgid ""
"The active orbitals always follow the closed-shell ones, and it is essential"
" to start with a qualitatively correct set of active orbitals in order to "
"converge to the desired solution. The AVAS procedure is often very helpful "
"to define the active space, see below."
msgstr ""
"活性轨道始终位于闭壳层轨道之后，并且必须从一组定性正确的活性轨道开始，才能收敛到所需的解。AVAS 程序通常对定义活性空间非常有帮助，见下文。"

msgid ""
"The active space must be defined in one of the following ways (or consistent"
" combinations of these):"
msgstr "活性空间必须通过以下方式之一（或这些方式的一致组合）定义："

msgid "Using OCC and CLOSED directives following the command line."
msgstr "使用命令行后的 OCC 和 CLOSED 指令。"

msgid "By specifying the active orbitals explicitly using SHELL directives."
msgstr "通过使用 SHELL 指令显式指定活性轨道。"

msgid ""
"SHELL directives are mandatory if more than one active shell is used. For "
"each shell the active orbitals are specified as"
msgstr "如果使用多于一个活性壳层，则 SHELL 指令是必需的。对于每个壳层，活性轨道按以下方式指定："

msgid ""
"If a subsequent CASCI calculation using  MULTI is performed using the CAHF "
"orbitals, the corresponding state-averaged CASSCF wave functions for the "
"individual states are obtained. The orbitals can also be employed in "
"subsequent multi-reference correlation methods, such as CASPT2 and MRCI. The"
" program is for example useful for the efficient calculation of transition-"
"metal/lanthanide/actinide compounds, where many nearly degenerate spin-"
"eigenstates are of interest."
msgstr ""
"如果随后使用 CAHF 轨道进行使用 MULTI 的 CASCI 计算，则会获得各个态对应的态平均 CASSCF "
"波函数。这些轨道也可用于后续的多参考关联方法，例如 CASPT2 和 "
"MRCI。该程序对于高效计算过渡金属/镧系/锕系化合物非常有用，其中许多近简并的自旋本征态是关注的重点。"

msgid ""
"Different optimization methods are available for the CAHF case. The default "
"is the classic SCF optimization, but the SO-SCI and quadratic optimization "
"of the RHF program are available as well. They can be activated by "
"``CAHF,SO-SCI`` for the SO-SCI method, or ``CAHF,SO`` for the quadratic "
"optimization. It is recommended to use the ``CAHF,SO-SCI`` optimization, "
"since it is often less expensive and more robust. Note that it is also "
"possible to carry out CAHF calculations using the `MULTI program "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#cahf-optimization-with-the-mcscf-program>`__."
msgstr ""
"对于CAHF情况，提供了不同的优化方法。默认是经典的SCF优化，但RHF程序的SO-SCI和二次优化方法也可用。可以通过\\ ``CAHF,SO-"
"SCI``\\ 来激活SO-SCI方法，或通过\\ ``CAHF,SO``\\ 来激活二次优化。建议使用\\ ``CAHF,SO-SCI``\\ "
"优化，因为它通常成本更低且更稳健。请注意，也可以使用\\ `MULTI程序 "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#cahfoptimizationwiththemcscfprogram>`__\\ "
"进行CAHF计算。"

msgid "Example:"
msgstr "示例："

msgid "Alternative:"
msgstr "替代方案："

msgid "This yields the same orbitals as"
msgstr "这将产生与以下相同的轨道："

msgid "Local density fitting configuration-averaged Hartree-Fock (LDF-CAHF)"
msgstr "局域密度拟合构型平均Hartree-Fock (LDF-CAHF)"

msgid ""
"calls the local density fitting configuration-averaged Hartree-Fock (LDF-"
"CAHF) described in P. P. Hallmen et. al, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4998815>`__ **147**, 164101 (2017), and for "
"multi-shell problems to `Phys. Chem. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1039/C9CP00785G>`__ **21**, 9769 (2019). The further "
"input is the same as for the non-local variant."
msgstr ""
"调用P. P. Hallmen等人描述的局域密度拟合构型平均Hartree-Fock (LDF-CAHF)，见\\ `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4998815>`__ **147**, 164101 (2017)，对于多壳层问题见\\ "
"`Phys. Chem. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1039/C9CP00785G>`__ **21**, "
"9769 (2019)。进一步的输入与非局域变体相同。"

msgid ""
"Considering accuracy, the same holds as for LDF-RHF. Local approximations "
"cause an overhead in the density fitting calculation of the Fock matrices, "
"and speedups can only be expected for rather large systems. For a molecule "
"as shown in the last example for df-cahf, the computation times of local and"
" non-local calculations are very similar, and it is not worthwhile to use "
"the local version."
msgstr ""
"在精度方面，情况与 LDF-RHF 相同。局域近似会在 Fock 矩阵的密度拟合计算中引入额外开销，只有在相当大的体系中才能预期获得加速。对于 df-"
"cahf 最后一个示例中所示的分子，局域和非局域计算的计算时间非常接近，因此使用局域版本并不值得。"

msgid "Options for the SCF program"
msgstr "SCF 程序的选项"

msgid "Options to control HF convergence"
msgstr "控制 HF 收敛的选项"

msgid "Note that in case of a restart the iteration count starts with 3."
msgstr "注意，在重启的情况下，迭代计数从 3 开始。"

msgid "Options for orbital localization"
msgstr "轨道定域化选项"

msgid ""
"The following options can be used to localize the RHF orbitals (not "
"implemented for UHF):"
msgstr "以下选项可用于定域化 RHF 轨道（未在 UHF 中实现）："

msgid ""
"Only the valence orbitals are localized, and the options only work without "
"symmetry. Alternatively the ``LOCALI`` program can be used for localization,"
" which offers more flexible options."
msgstr "仅对价层轨道进行定域化，且这些选项仅在无对称性时有效。或者，可以使用 ``LOCALI`` 程序进行定域化，它提供了更灵活的选项。"

msgid "Options for the diagonalization method"
msgstr "对角化方法选项"

msgid ""
"In calculations with very large basis sets, the diagonalization time becomes"
" a significant fraction of the total CPU time. This can be reduced using the"
" orbital rotation method as described in R. Polly, H.-J. Werner, F. R. "
"Manby, and Peter J. Knowles, `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/0026897042000274801>`__ **102**, 2311 (2004))"
msgstr ""
"在使用非常大的基组的计算中，对角化时间会占总 CPU 时间的很大一部分。这可以通过使用轨道旋转方法来减少，如 R. Polly, H.-J. "
"Werner, F. R. Manby, 和 Peter J. Knowles 在 `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/0026897042000274801>`__ **102**, 2311 (2004) "
"中所述。"

msgid "Options for convergence acceleration methods (DIIS)"
msgstr "收敛加速方法选项（DIIS）"

msgid "Options for integral direct calculations"
msgstr "直接积分计算选项"

msgid "``DIRECT`` (logical). If given, do integral-direct HF."
msgstr "``DIRECT`` （逻辑值）。若给定，则执行直接积分 HF。"

msgid "Special options for UHF calculations"
msgstr "UHF 计算的特殊选项"

msgid "Options for polarizabilities"
msgstr "极化率选项"

msgid "Printing options"
msgstr "打印选项"

msgid "Options for the SO-SCI optimization"
msgstr "SO-SCI 优化选项"

msgid ""
"Since Molpro 2021, it is possible to use the SO-SCI optimization of multi "
"(see `so-sci <the_mcscf_program_multi.html#combined-first-and-second-order-"
"optimization-default>`__) within the RHF program, which is activated by "
"``HF,SO-SCI``. All open-shell orbitals are added to the active space and "
"optimized at second-order level. The remaining closed-virtual optimization "
"is approximated at first-order level. This often solves convergence problems"
" for difficult open-shell systems."
msgstr ""
"自 Molpro 2021 起，可以在 RHF 程序中使用 multi 的 SO-SCI 优化（参见 `so-sci "
"<the_mcscf_program_multi.html#combinedfirst-andsecond-"
"orderoptimizationdefault>`__\\ ），该功能通过 ``HF,SO-SCI`` "
"激活。所有开壳层轨道均被添加到活性空间中，并在二阶水平上进行优化。剩余的闭壳层-虚轨道优化则在一阶水平上进行近似。这通常能解决困难开壳层体系的收敛问题。"

msgid ""
"In case of closed-shell systems, the HOMO and the LUMO orbital are put "
"automatically into the active space and optimized quadratically. The "
"selection of the HOMO and LUMO orbitals is based on the orbital energies of "
"the starting/input orbitals. The following options are available for the "
"selection:"
msgstr ""
"对于闭壳层体系，HOMO 和 LUMO 轨道会自动放入活性空间并进行二次优化。HOMO 和 LUMO "
"轨道的选择基于起始/输入轨道的轨道能量。以下选项可用于选择："

msgid ""
"``SO_SCI_MAX_0`` Maximum number of virtual orbitals taken by the threshold "
"criterion (default: 5)"
msgstr "``SO_SCI_MAX_0`` 根据阈值标准选取的虚轨道的最大数量（默认值：5）"

msgid ""
"The selection can be also activated for open-shell systems by setting "
"``SO_SCI_THRESH`` manually."
msgstr "对于开壳层体系，也可以通过手动设置 ``SO_SCI_THRESH`` 来激活此选择。"

msgid ""
"As an alternative, the fully quadratic optimization is available by "
"``HF,SO``."
msgstr "作为替代方案，完全二次优化可通过 ``HF,SO`` 实现。"

msgid "Quadratic optimization of the AVAS orbitals"
msgstr "AVAS 轨道的二次优化"

msgid ""
"It is possible to optimize all active orbitals from the given starting "
"record quadratically by setting ``HF,SO-SCI-ACTIVE``. This enables for "
"example the quadratic optimization of all active orbitals selected by the "
"AVAS program, which often improves the convergence of transition metal "
"complexes considerably for which the correct ordering of the 3d orbitals "
"might be challenging."
msgstr ""
"通过设置 ``HF,SO-SCI-ACTIVE``\\ ，可以对给定起始记录中的所有活性轨道进行二次优化。例如，这使得可以对 AVAS "
"程序选择的所有活性轨道进行二次优化，这通常能显著改善过渡金属配合物的收敛性，因为其 3d 轨道的正确排序可能具有挑战性。"

msgid "Defining the wavefunction"
msgstr "定义波函数"

msgid ""
"The number of electrons and the total symmetry of the wavefunction are "
"specified on the ``WF`` card:"
msgstr "电子数和波函数的总对称性在 ``WF`` 卡片上指定："

msgid "where"
msgstr "其中"

msgid ""
"Note that these values take sensible defaults if any or all are not "
"specified (see section `symmetry "
"<general_program_structure.html#symmetry>`__). For example, ``{rhf; "
"wf,sym=N,spin=M}`` gives the explicit values N for the symmetry and M for "
"the spin of the wave function, but uses the default number of electrons."
msgstr ""
"请注意，如果任何或所有值未指定，这些值会采用合理的默认值（参见 `对称性 "
"<general_program_structure.html#symmetry>`__ 一节）。例如，\\ ``{rhf; "
"wf,sym=N,spin=M}`` 给出了对称性的显式值 N 和波函数自旋的显式值 M，但使用默认的电子数。"

msgid ""
"In HF/RHF, the spin has to be equal to the number of singly occupied "
"orbitals, i.e. the electrons couple to a high-spin state. For example, an "
"open-shell singlet state cannot be described on this level. Instead, for "
"states which are not high-spin, MCSCF has to be used."
msgstr ""
"在HF/RHF中，自旋必须等于单占据轨道的数量，即电子耦合为高自旋态。例如，开壳层单重态无法在此级别描述。相反，对于非高自旋态，必须使用MCSCF。"

msgid "Defining the number of occupied orbitals in each symmetry"
msgstr "定义每个对称性中的占据轨道数量"

msgid ""
"To avoid convergence problems in cases with high symmetry, this card should "
"be included whenever the occupation pattern is known in advance. :math:`n_i`"
" is the number of occupied orbitals in the irreducible representation "
":math:`i`. The total number of orbitals must be equal to (*elec+spin*)/2 "
"(see ``WF`` card)."
msgstr ""
"为避免高对称性情况下的收敛问题，当占据模式已知时，应包含此卡片。\\ :math:`n_i` 是不可约表示 :math:`i` "
"中的占据轨道数量。轨道总数必须等于 (*elec+spin*)/2（参见 ``WF`` 卡片）。"

msgid "Specifying closed-shell orbitals"
msgstr "指定闭壳层轨道"

msgid ""
"This optional card can be used in open-shell calculations to specify the "
"number of closed-shell orbitals in each symmetry. This makes possible to "
"force specific states in the absence of an ``OPEN`` card."
msgstr "此可选卡片可用于开壳层计算中，指定每个对称性中的闭壳层轨道数量。这使得在没有 ``OPEN`` 卡片的情况下强制指定特定态成为可能。"

msgid "Specifying open-shell orbitals"
msgstr "指定开壳层轨道"

msgid ""
"This optional card can be used to specify the singly occupied orbitals. The "
"number of singly occupied orbitals must be equal to *spin*, and their "
"symmetry product must be equal to *sym* (see ``WF`` card). If the ``OPEN`` "
"card is not present, the open shell orbitals are selected automatically. The"
" algorithm tries to find the ground state, but it might happen that a wrong "
"state is obtained if there are several possibilities for distributing the "
"open shell electrons among the available orbitals. This can also be avoided "
"using the ``CLOSED`` card. If :math:`orb_i.sym` is negative, this orbital "
"will be occupied with negative spin (only allowed in UHF)."
msgstr ""
"此可选卡片可用于指定单占据轨道。单占据轨道的数量必须等于 *spin*\\ ，且其对称性乘积必须等于 *sym*\\ （参见 ``WF`` "
"卡片）。如果未提供 ``OPEN`` "
"卡片，开壳层轨道将自动选择。算法尝试寻找基态，但如果存在多种在可用轨道间分布开壳层电子的可能性，则可能得到错误的状态。这也可以通过使用 "
"``CLOSED`` 卡片来避免。如果 :math:`orb_i.sym` 为负值，则该轨道将被负自旋占据（仅在 UHF 中允许）。"

msgid "Saving the final orbitals"
msgstr "保存最终轨道"

msgid ""
"The optimized orbitals, and the corresponding density matrix, fock matrix, "
"and orbital energies are saved on *record.file*. ``SAVE`` is an alias for "
"``ORBITAL``. If this card is not present, the defaults for  *record* are:"
msgstr ""
"优化后的轨道，以及相应的密度矩阵、Fock 矩阵和轨道能量将保存在 *record.file* 上。\\ ``SAVE`` 是 ``ORBITAL`` "
"的别名。如果未提供此卡片，\\ *record* 的默认值为："

msgid "``RHF`` 2100"
msgstr "``RHF`` 2100"

msgid ""
"``UHF`` 2200 (holds both :math:`\\alpha` and :math:`\\beta`-spin orbitals "
"and related quantities)"
msgstr "``UHF`` 2200（保存 :math:`\\alpha` 和 :math:`\\beta` 自旋轨道及相关量）"

msgid ""
"These numbers are incremented by one for each subsequent calculation of the "
"same type in the same input. Note that this holds for the sequence number in"
" the input, independently in which order they are executed (see section "
"`records <general_program_structure.html#records>`__)."
msgstr ""
"对于同一输入文件中相同类型的后续计算，这些数字会逐一递增。请注意，这适用于输入中的序列号，与其执行顺序无关（参见 `records "
"<general_program_structure.html#records>`__ 一节）。"

msgid "The default for *file* is 2."
msgstr "*file* 的默认值为 2。"

msgid "Starting orbitals"
msgstr "起始轨道"

msgid ""
"The ``START`` directive can be used to specify the initial orbitals used in "
"the SCF iteration. It is either possible to generate an initial orbital "
"guess, or to start with previously optimized orbitals. Alternatively, one "
"can also use a previous density matrix to construct the first fock operator."
msgstr ""
"``START`` 指令可用于指定 SCF "
"迭代中使用的初始轨道。既可以生成初始轨道初猜，也可以从先前优化过的轨道开始。或者，也可以使用先前的密度矩阵来构建第一个 Fock 算符。"

msgid ""
"If the ``START`` card is absent, the program tries to find suitable starting"
" orbitals as follows:"
msgstr "如果缺少 ``START`` 卡片，程序将尝试按以下方式寻找合适的起始轨道："

msgid ""
"**First:** Try to read orbitals from *record* specified on the ``ORBITAL`` "
"or ``SAVE`` card or the corresponding default (see ``ORBITAL``). All files "
"are searched."
msgstr ""
"**首先：** 尝试从 ``ORBITAL`` 或 ``SAVE`` 卡片上指定的 *record* 或相应的默认值（参见 ``ORBITAL``\\ "
"）读取轨道。将搜索所有文件。"

msgid ""
"**Second:** Try to find orbitals from a previous SCF or MCSCF calculation. "
"All files are searched."
msgstr "**其次：** 尝试从前一次 SCF 或 MCSCF 计算中寻找轨道。将搜索所有文件。"

msgid ""
"**Third:** If no orbitals are found, the starting orbitals are generated "
"using approximate atomic densities or eigenvectors of :math:`h` (see below)."
msgstr "**第三：** 如果未找到任何轨道，则使用近似的原子密度或 :math:`h` 的特征向量生成起始轨道（见下文）。"

msgid ""
"Since these defaults are usually appropriate, the ``START`` card is not "
"required in most cases."
msgstr "由于这些默认设置通常是合适的，因此在大多数情况下不需要 ``START`` 卡片。"

msgid "Initial orbital guess"
msgstr "初始轨道初猜"

msgid "An initial orbital guess can be requested as follows:"
msgstr "可按如下方式请求初始轨道初猜："

msgid "The *option* keyword can be:"
msgstr "*option* 关键字可以是："

msgid ""
"``H0`` Use eigenvectors of :math:`h` (core Hamiltonian) as starting guess."
msgstr "``H0`` 使用 :math:`h`\\ （核心哈密顿量）的本征向量作为初始猜测。"

msgid ""
"``ATDEN`` Use natural orbitals of a diagonal density matrix constructed "
"using atomic orbitals and atomic occupation numbers (default)."
msgstr "``ATDEN`` 使用由原子轨道和原子占据数构建的对角密度矩阵的自然轨道（默认）。"

msgid ""
"Note that it is also possible to use orbitals from previous (e.g., smaller "
"basis set) calculations as starting orbitals (see section `starting with "
"previous orbitals <the_scf_program.html#starting-with-previous-orbitals>`__ "
"below)."
msgstr ""
"请注意，也可以使用先前（例如，较小基组）计算中的轨道作为起始轨道（参见下文 `starting with previous orbitals "
"<the_scf_program.html#starting-with-previous-orbitals>`__ 一节）。"

msgid ""
"The second calculation uses the optimized orbitals of the STO-3G calculation"
" as starting guess. This is done by default and no ``START`` card is "
"necessary. The explicit use of ``START`` and ``SAVE`` cards is demonstrated "
"in the example in the next section."
msgstr ""
"第二次计算使用 STO-3G 计算的优化轨道作为初始猜测。这是默认行为，无需使用 ``START`` 卡片。下一节的示例将演示 ``START`` 和 "
"``SAVE`` 卡片的显式用法。"

msgid ""
"The following input is entirely equivalent to the one in the previous "
"section:"
msgstr "以下输入与上一节中的输入完全等效："

msgid "Starting with previous orbitals"
msgstr "使用先前轨道"

msgid ""
"reads previously optimized orbitals from record *record* on file *file*. "
"Optionally, a specific orbital set can be specified as described in section "
"`selecting orbitals and density matrices (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__."
msgstr ""
"从文件 *file* 的记录 *record* 中读取先前优化的轨道。可选地，可以按照章节 `选择轨道和密度矩阵 (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__ 中的描述指定特定的轨道集。"

msgid ""
"The specified dump record may correspond to a different geometry, basis set,"
" and/or symmetry than used in the present calculation. Using starting "
"orbitals from a different basis set can be useful if no previous orbitals "
"are available and the ``ATDENS`` option cannot be used (see above)."
msgstr ""
"指定的转储记录可能对应于与当前计算不同的几何结构、基组和/或对称性。使用来自不同基组的初始轨道可能很有用，如果没有先前的轨道可用且 ``ATDENS``"
" 选项无法使用（见上文）。"

msgid ""
"The following example shows how to change the symmetry between scf "
"calculations. Of course, this example is quite useless, but sometimes it "
"might be easier first to obtain a solution in higher symmetry and then "
"convert this to lower symmetry for further calculations."
msgstr ""
"以下示例展示了如何在 SCF "
"计算之间改变对称性。当然，这个示例本身没什么用，但有时可能更容易先在高对称性下获得解，然后将其转换为低对称性以进行后续计算。"

msgid ""
"Note, however, that this only works well if the orientation of the molecule "
"does not change. Sometimes it might be helpful to use the ``noorient`` "
"option."
msgstr "但请注意，这仅在分子取向不变时效果良好。有时使用 ``noorient`` 选项可能会有帮助。"

msgid ""
"Note also that a single dump record cannot hold orbitals for different basis"
" dimensions. Using ``save=2100.2`` in the second calculation would therefore"
" produce an error."
msgstr "还需注意，单个转储记录无法容纳不同基组维度的轨道。因此在第二次计算中使用 ``save=2100.2`` 会产生错误。"

msgid ""
"If orbitals from a corresponding SCF calculation at a neighbouring geometry "
"are available, these should be used as starting guess."
msgstr "如果邻近几何结构下相应 SCF 计算的轨道可用，则应将其用作起始猜测。"

msgid "Starting with a previous density matrix"
msgstr "从先前的密度矩阵开始"

msgid ""
"A density matrix is read from the given dump record and used for "
"constructing the first fock matrix. A specific density matrix can be "
"specified as described in section `selecting orbitals and density matrices "
"(ORBITAL, DENSITY) <general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-"
"density-matrices-orbital-density>`__. It is normally not recommended to use "
"the ``DENSITY`` option."
msgstr ""
"从给定的转储记录中读取密度矩阵，并用于构建第一个 Fock 矩阵。可以按照章节 `选择轨道和密度矩阵 (ORBITAL, DENSITY) "
"<general_program_structure.html#selecting-orbitals-and-density-matrices-"
"orbital-density>`__ 中的描述指定特定的密度矩阵。通常不建议使用 ``DENSITY`` 选项。"

msgid "Starting with AVAS orbitals"
msgstr "从 AVAS 轨道开始"

msgid "Rotating pairs of orbitals"
msgstr "旋转轨道对"

msgid ""
"Performs a :math:`2\\times 2` rotation of the initial orbitals :math:`orb_1`"
" and :math:`orb_2` in symmetry *sym* by *angle* degrees. With *angle*\\ "
":math:`=0` the orbitals are exchanged. See ``MERGE`` for other possibilities"
" to manipulate orbitals. In ``UHF``, by default only the :math:`\\beta`-spin"
" orbitals are rotated. The initial :math:`\\alpha`-spin orbitals can be "
"rotated using"
msgstr ""
"对初始轨道 :math:`orb_1` 和 :math:`orb_2` 在对称性 *sym* 中执行 :math:`2\\times 2` "
"旋转，旋转角度为 *angle* 度。当 *angle*\\ :math:`=0` 时，轨道被交换。有关操作轨道的其他可能性，请参见 "
"``MERGE``\\ 。在 ``UHF`` 中，默认情况下仅旋转 :math:`\\beta`-自旋轨道。初始的 "
":math:`\\alpha`-自旋轨道可以使用以下方式旋转"

msgid "In this case ``ROTATEB`` is an alias for ``ROTATE``."
msgstr "在这种情况下，\\ ``ROTATEB`` 是 ``ROTATE`` 的别名。"

msgid "Using additional point-group symmetry"
msgstr "使用额外的点群对称性"

msgid ""
"Since *MOLPRO* can handle only Abelian point-groups, there may be more "
"symmetry than explicitly used. For instance, if linear molecules are treated"
" in :math:`C_{2v}` instead of :math:`C_{\\infty v}`, the "
":math:`\\delta_{(x^2-y^2)}`-orbitals appear in symmetry 1 (:math:`A_1`). In "
"other cases, a linear geometry may occur as a special case of calculations "
"in :math:`C_S` symmetry, and then one component of the :math:`\\pi`-orbitals"
" occurs in symmetry 1 (:math:`A'`). The program is able to detect such "
"hidden “extra” symmetries by blockings in the one-electron hamiltonian "
":math:`h` and the overlap matrix :math:`S`. Within each irreducible "
"representation, an “extra” symmetry number is then assigned to each basis "
"function. These numbers are printed at the end of the integral output. "
"Usually, the extra symmetries are ordered with increasing :math:`l`-quantum "
"number of the basis functions. This information can be used to determine and"
" fix the extra symmetries of the molecular orbitals by means of the ``SYM`` "
"command."
msgstr ""
"由于 *MOLPRO* 只能处理阿贝尔点群，因此可能存在比显式使用的更多的对称性。例如，如果线性分子在 :math:`C_{2v}` 中处理而不是在 "
":math:`C_{\\infty v}` 中，则 :math:`\\delta_{(x^2-y^2)}`-轨道会出现在对称性 1 "
"(:math:`A_1`) 中。在其他情况下，线性几何结构可能作为 :math:`C_S` 对称性计算中的一个特例出现，此时 "
":math:`\\pi`-轨道的一个分量出现在对称性 1 (:math:`A'`) 中。程序能够通过单电子哈密顿量 :math:`h` 和重叠矩阵 "
":math:`S` "
"中的分块来检测此类隐藏的“额外”对称性。在每个不可约表示内，会为每个基函数分配一个“额外”对称性编号。这些编号在积分输出的末尾打印。通常，额外对称性按照基函数的"
" :math:`l`-量子数递增顺序排列。此信息可用于通过 ``SYM`` 命令确定并固定分子轨道的额外对称性。"

msgid ""
":math:`sym(i)` are the extra symmetries for the first :math:`n` orbitals in "
"the irreducible representation *irrep*. For instance, if you want that in a "
"linear molecule the orbitals 1.1 to 3.1 are :math:`\\sigma` and 4.1, 5.1 "
":math:`\\delta`, the ``SYM`` card would read (calculation done with X,Y as "
"symmetry generators):"
msgstr ""
":math:`sym(i)` 是\\ *不可约表示* *irrep* 中前 :math:`n` 个轨道的额外对称性。例如，如果您希望在线性分子中，轨道 "
"1.1 到 3.1 是 :math:`\\sigma` 轨道，而轨道 4.1 和 5.1 是 :math:`\\delta` 轨道，则 ``SYM`` "
"卡片应写为（计算以 X, Y 作为对称性生成元进行）："

msgid "``SYM,1,1,1,1,2,2``"
msgstr "``SYM,1,1,1,1,2,2``"

msgid ""
"If necessary, the program will reorder the orbitals in each iteration to "
"force this occupation. The symmetries of occupied and virtual orbitals may "
"be specified. By default, symmetry contaminations are not removed. If "
"*irrep* is set negative, however, symmetry contaminations are removed. Note "
"that this may prevent convergence if degenerate orbitals are present."
msgstr ""
"如有必要，程序将在每次迭代中重新排序轨道以强制实现此占据。可以指定占据轨道和虚轨道的对称性。默认情况下，对称性污染不会被移除。然而，如果 *irrep*"
" 设置为负值，则会移除对称性污染。请注意，如果存在简并轨道，这可能会阻碍收敛。"

msgid "Expectation values"
msgstr "期望值"

msgid ""
"Calculates expectation values for one-electron operators :math:`oper_1`, "
":math:`oper_2`, :math:`\\ldots`, :math:`oper_n`. See section `One-electron "
"operators and expectation values (GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-"
"electron-operators-and-expectation-values-gexpec>`__ for the available "
"operators. By default, the dipole moments are computed. Normally, it is "
"recommended to use the ``GEXPEC`` directive if expectation values for other "
"operators are of interest. See section `One-electron operators and "
"expectation values (GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-electron-operators-"
"and-expectation-values-gexpec>`__ for details."
msgstr ""
"计算单电子算符 :math:`oper_1`, :math:`oper_2`, :math:`\\ldots`, :math:`oper_n` "
"的期望值。有关可用算符，请参阅章节 `单电子算符和期望值 (GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-electron-"
"operators-and-expectation-values-gexpec>`__\\ "
"。默认情况下，会计算偶极矩。通常，如果对其他算符的期望值感兴趣，建议使用 ``GEXPEC`` 指令。详情请参阅章节 `单电子算符和期望值 "
"(GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-electron-operators-and-expectation-"
"values-gexpec>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Polarizabilities"
msgstr "极化率"

msgid ""
"Calculates polarizabilities for the given operators :math:`oper_1`, "
":math:`oper_2`, :math:`\\ldots`, :math:`oper_n`.. See section `One-electron "
"operators and expectation values (GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-"
"electron-operators-and-expectation-values-gexpec>`__ for the available "
"operators. If no operators are specified, the dipole polarizabilities are "
"computed."
msgstr ""
"计算给定算符 :math:`oper_1`, :math:`oper_2`, :math:`\\ldots`, :math:`oper_n` "
"的极化率。可用算符请参阅章节 `单电子算符与期望值 (GEXPEC) <program_control.html#one-electron-"
"operators-and-expectation-values-gexpec>`__\\ 。若未指定算符，则计算偶极极化率。"

msgid ""
"Presently, this is working only for closed-shell without direct option."
msgstr "目前，此功能仅适用于不使用直接选项的闭壳层计算。"

msgid ""
"The polarizabilities are stored in the variables ``POLXX, POLXY, POLXZ, "
"POLYY, POLYZ, POLZZ``."
msgstr "极化率存储在变量 ``POLXX, POLXY, POLXZ, POLYY, POLYZ, POLZZ`` 中。"

msgid "Miscellaneous directives"
msgstr "杂项指令"

msgid ""
"All commands described in this section are optional. Appropriate default "
"values are normally used."
msgstr "本节描述的所有命令均为可选。通常使用适当的默认值。"

msgid "Level shifts"
msgstr "能级位移"

msgid ""
"A level shift of *shifta* and *shiftb* hartree for :math:`\\alpha`- and "
":math:`\\beta`-spin orbitals, respectively, is applied. This can improve "
"convergence, but has no effect on the solution. *shifta*\\ :math:`=-0.2` to "
":math:`-0.3` are typical values. The defaults are *shifta*\\ :math:`=0` and "
"*shifta*\\ :math:`=-0.3` in closed and open-shell calculations, "
"respectively, and *shiftb*\\ :math:`=0`."
msgstr ""
"对 :math:`\\alpha`- 和 :math:`\\beta`-自旋轨道分别施加 *shifta* 和 *shiftb* "
"哈特里单位的能级位移。这可以改善收敛性，但对解没有影响。\\ *shifta*\\ :math:`=-0.2` 到 :math:`-0.3` "
"是典型值。默认情况下，在闭壳层和开壳层计算中，\\ *shifta*\\ :math:`=0` 和 *shifta*\\ :math:`=-0.3`\\"
" ，而 *shiftb*\\ :math:`=0`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"Applying large negative level shifts like ``{rhf; shift,-1.0,-0.5}`` will "
"often stabilize convergence at the expense of making it somewhat slower. See"
" section `handling difficult cases: When SCF does not converge "
"<the_scf_program.html#handling-difficult-cases-when-scf-does-not-"
"converge>`__."
msgstr ""
"应用较大的负能级位移，如 ``{rhf; shift,-1.0,-0.5}``\\ ，通常能稳定收敛，但代价是收敛速度会稍慢一些。参见章节 "
"`处理困难情况：当SCF不收敛时 <the_scf_program.html#handling-difficult-cases-when-scf-"
"does-not-converge>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Maximum number of iterations"
msgstr "最大迭代次数"

msgid ""
"sets the maximum number of iterations to *maxit*. The default is *maxit*\\ "
":math:`=60`."
msgstr "将最大迭代次数设置为 *maxit*\\ 。默认值为 *maxit*\\ :math:`=60`\\ 。"

msgid "Convergence threshold"
msgstr "收敛阈值"

msgid "Sanity check on the energy"
msgstr "能量合理性检查"

msgid "``NOENEST``"
msgstr "``NOENEST``"

msgid ""
"This disables the sanity check on the energy even if the energy value is "
"unreasonable. Otherwise, the energy will be automatically checked by "
"default."
msgstr "即使能量值不合理，此选项也会禁用能量合理性检查。否则，默认情况下会自动检查能量。"

msgid "Print options"
msgstr "打印选项"

msgid ""
"This determines the number of virtual orbitals printed at the end of the "
"calculation. By default, *print*\\ :math:`=0`, i.e., only the occupied "
"orbitals are printed. *print*\\ :math:`=-1` suppresses printing of orbitals "
"entirely. *test*\\ :math:`=1` has the additional effect of printing the "
"orbitals after each iteration."
msgstr ""
"此选项决定在计算结束时打印的虚轨道数量。默认情况下，\\ *print*\\ :math:`=0`\\ ，即仅打印占据轨道。\\ *print*\\ "
":math:`=-1` 完全禁止打印轨道。\\ *test*\\ :math:`=1` 具有在每次迭代后打印轨道的额外效果。"

msgid "Interpolation"
msgstr "插值"

msgid ""
"This command controls iterative subspace interpolation. *iptyp* can be:"
msgstr "此命令控制迭代子空间插值。\\ *iptyp* 可以是："

msgid ""
"``DIIS`` direct inversion of the iterative subspace. This is the default and"
" usually yields fast and stable convergence."
msgstr "``DIIS`` 迭代子空间的直接求逆。这是默认方法，通常能实现快速且稳定的收敛。"

msgid ""
"``KAIN`` Krylov-subspace accelerated inexact newton. A method similar to "
"DIIS."
msgstr "``KAIN`` Krylov子空间加速的不精确牛顿法。一种类似于DIIS的方法。"

msgid "``NONE`` No interpolation."
msgstr "``NONE`` 无插值。"

msgid ""
":math:`ipnit` is the number of the iteration in which the interpolation "
"starts (default: as soon as possible).  *ipstep* is the iteration increment "
"between interpolations (default: 1, i.e., every iteration). *maxdis* is the "
"maximum dimension of the DIIS matrix (default 10). *iptyp* and *maxdis* can "
"also be set as options. E.g.,"
msgstr ""
":math:`ipnit` 是插值开始的迭代次数（默认：尽快开始）。\\ *ipstep* 是插值之间的迭代增量（默认：1，即每次迭代）。\\ "
"*maxdis* 是DIIS矩阵的最大维度（默认10）。\\ *iptyp* 和 *maxdis* 也可以作为选项设置。例如，"

msgid "``{rhf,maxdis=20,iptyp=’DIIS’; shift,-1.0,-0.5}``"
msgstr "``{rhf,maxdis=20,iptyp=’DIIS’; shift,-1.0,-0.5}``"

msgid "Reorthonormalization of the orbitals"
msgstr "轨道的重新正交归一化"

msgid ""
"The orbitals are reorthonormalized after every *nitort* iterations. The "
"default is *nitort*\\ :math:`=10`."
msgstr "轨道在每 *nitort* 次迭代后重新正交归一化。默认值为 *nitort*\\ :math:`=10`\\ 。"

msgid "Direct SCF"
msgstr "直接自洽场"

msgid ""
"If this card is present, the calculation is done in direct mode. See section"
" `INTEGRAL-DIRECT CALCULATIONS (GDIRECT) <integration.html#integral-direct-"
"calculations-gdirect>`__ for options. Normally, it is recommended to use the"
" global ``GDIRECT`` command to request the direct mode. See section "
"`INTEGRAL-DIRECT CALCULATIONS (GDIRECT) <integration.html#integral-direct-"
"calculations-gdirect>`__ for details."
msgstr ""
"如果存在此卡片，计算将在直接模式下进行。有关选项，请参阅章节 `INTEGRAL-DIRECT CALCULATIONS (GDIRECT) "
"<integration.html#integral-direct-calculations-gdirect>`__\\ 。通常，建议使用全局命令 "
"``GDIRECT`` 来请求直接模式。详情请参阅章节 `INTEGRAL-DIRECT CALCULATIONS (GDIRECT) "
"<integration.html#integral-direct-calculations-gdirect>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Handling difficult cases: When SCF does not converge"
msgstr "处理困难情况：当 SCF 不收敛时"

msgid "General suggestions:"
msgstr "一般建议："

msgid ""
"Carry out convergence experiments with a small but reasonable basis set "
"(e.g., cc-pVDZ, def2-SVP, aug-cc-pVDZ, ASVP). STO-3G is *not* a reasonable "
"basis set."
msgstr ""
"使用一个较小但合理的基组（例如，cc-pVDZ、def2-SVP、aug-cc-pVDZ、ASVP）进行收敛性实验。STO-3G *不是* "
"一个合理的基组。"

msgid "Before you start you should check:"
msgstr "在开始之前，您应该检查："

msgid ""
"Whether your geometry is sensible (e.g., look for Angstrom/Bohr conversion "
"issues). Note that Molpro prints bond distances in both Angstroms and atomic"
" units at the top of an output."
msgstr "您的几何结构是否合理（例如，检查埃/玻尔转换问题）。请注意，Molpro 在输出文件顶部会同时打印以埃和原子单位为单位的键长。"

msgid ""
"Whether you have selected the correct electronic state (spin and symmetry). "
"Molpro tries to guess spatial symmetries of open-shell compounds "
"automatically if none are provided. However, the guess is not always right. "
"In such a case you need to give the symmetry manually (in the simplest case "
"as ``wf,sym=N,spin=M``. See section `defining the wavefunction "
"<the_scf_program.html#defining-the-wavefunction>`__). Molpro does attempts "
"to find the ground state configuration from the Aufbau principle, but this "
"may fail and then the wave function symmetry and spin need to be specified "
"using a WF (wave function) directive"
msgstr ""
"您是否选择了正确的电子态（自旋和对称性）。Molpro "
"会尝试自动猜测未提供空间对称性的开壳层化合物的对称性。然而，这种猜测并不总是正确的。在这种情况下，您需要手动指定对称性（最简单的情况是使用 "
"``wf,sym=N,spin=M``\\ 。请参阅章节 `定义波函数 <the_scf_program.html#defining-the-"
"wavefunction>`__\\ ）。Molpro 确实会尝试根据奥夫鲍原理找到基态构型，但这可能会失败，此时需要使用 "
"WF（波函数）指令来指定波函数的对称性和自旋。"

msgid ""
"With older Molpro versions, which do not contain the new MCSCF program, the "
"following techniques can be attempted:"
msgstr "对于不包含新MCSCF程序的旧版Molpro，可以尝试以下技术："

msgid "Hartree-Fock options & Small-basis initial guess:"
msgstr "Hartree-Fock 选项与小基组初始猜测："

msgid ""
"**Level shifts:** Adding a level shift like ``{rhf; shift,-1.0,-0.5}`` "
"stabilizes the current RHF solution against changes and leads to smoother "
"(but slower) convergence. That should be your first try; it is often "
"sufficient."
msgstr ""
"**能级位移：** 添加能级位移如 ``{rhf; shift,-1.0,-0.5}`` 可稳定当前 RHF "
"解，使其不易受变化影响，并带来更平缓（但更慢）的收敛。这应是您的首选尝试；通常已足够。"

msgid "Cationic or Anionic initial guess:"
msgstr "阳离子或阴离子初始猜测："

msgid ""
"If molecule :math:`X` does not converge, it might still be possible to "
"converge :math:`X^+` (:math:`X^{2+}`, ..) and use this as initial guess for "
"the actual computation. Particularly if :math:`X^+` is a closed-shell "
"compound this will often work. If using this technique, you need to be "
"careful about the final state you arrive in. Because your initial guess is "
"biased, the :math:`X` calculation might converge to an excited state."
msgstr ""
"如果分子 :math:`X` 不收敛，仍有可能收敛 :math:`X^+` (:math:`X^{2+}`, ..) "
"并将其用作实际计算的初始猜测。特别是当 :math:`X^+` "
"是闭壳层化合物时，这通常有效。使用此技术时，需要注意最终到达的状态。由于初始猜测存在偏向，\\ :math:`X` 的计算可能会收敛到激发态。"

msgid "Density-functional initial guess:"
msgstr "密度泛函初始猜测："

msgid ""
"For transition metals and transition states sometimes DFT methods show "
"better convergence behavior than RHF. You might perform a DFT calculation "
"(possibly with a smaller basis set) and use it as initial guess for the SCF."
" E.g., ``{df-rks,b-lyp; coarsegrid; save,2100.2}`` ``{df-rhf,nitord=1; "
"orbital,2100.2}``"
msgstr ""
"对于过渡金属和过渡态，有时 DFT 方法比 RHF 表现出更好的收敛行为。您可以执行 DFT 计算（可能使用较小的基组），并将其用作 SCF "
"的初始猜测。例如，\\ ``{df-rks,b-lyp; coarsegrid; save,2100.2}`` ``{df-rhf,nitord=1; "
"orbital,2100.2}``"

msgid ""
"If all else fails: Use the MCSCF program. The MCSCF program uses an advanced"
" orbital optimization algorithm which is much more robust than the SCF "
"method, and which can converge almost everything you give to it (but it is "
"often slower and sometimes locks on an excited state if started from an "
"atomic density guess). MCSCF can also calculate Hartree-Fock solutions if "
"used with suitable input cards."
msgstr ""
"如果所有其他方法都失败：使用 MCSCF 程序。MCSCF 程序使用先进的轨道优化算法，比 SCF "
"方法稳健得多，几乎可以收敛您提供的任何体系（但通常速度较慢，并且如果从原子密度猜测开始，有时会锁定在激发态）。如果使用合适的输入卡片，MCSCF "
"也可以计算 Hartree-Fock 解。"

msgid "Stability check: Eigenvalues of the orbital Hessian"
msgstr "稳定性检查：轨道 Hessian 矩阵的本征值"

msgid "Advanced use: Core-excited states"
msgstr "高级应用：核心激发态"

msgid ""
"Some kinds of excited or higher ionized states can be calculated using a so-"
"called delta-SCF procedure. Here the excitation/ionization energy is "
"obtained as difference of the SCF solutions for the ground state and the "
"excited/ionized state. If the excited state is reasonably well described by "
"a single determinant, this procedure is normally quite accurate."
msgstr ""
"某些类型的激发态或更高电离态可以使用所谓的 delta-SCF 程序计算。此处，激发/电离能量是通过基态和激发/电离态的 SCF "
"解之间的差值获得的。如果激发态能够被单个行列式合理地描述，此程序通常相当准确。"

msgid ""
"shows how to use the delta-SCF procedure to calculate the N 1s core binding "
"energy in pyridine, by employing localized orbitals and moving them to the "
"HOMO position using a ROTATE card (Sec. `rotating pairs of orbitals "
"<the_scf_program.html#rotating-pairs-of-orbitals>`__). In the core-excited "
"state calculation, SCF is prevented from collapsing to the ground state by "
"using the option NITORD=1 (Sec. `options <the_scf_program.html#options>`__),"
" which asks SCF to lock onto the input solution."
msgstr ""
"展示了如何使用 delta-SCF 程序计算吡啶中 N 1s 核心结合能，通过使用定域轨道并使用 ROTATE 卡片（见 `旋转轨道对 "
"<the_scf_program.html#rotating-pairs-of-orbitals>`__ 节）将它们移动到 HOMO "
"位置。在核心激发态计算中，通过使用选项 NITORD=1（见 `选项 <the_scf_program.html#options>`__ 节）来防止 "
"SCF 塌缩到基态，该选项要求 SCF 锁定在输入的解决方案上。"
